            "review_text": "Vacation58759169403\n3 contributions\n0\nClean space and friendly enthusiastic staff\nMay 2024 • Couples\nI have been to many places and eaten many authentic vermicelli noodles, but I find the vermicelli noodles here are the best. The meat is fragrant and the fish sauce has a sweet taste that everyone should try.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten June 3, 2024",
